-- title:
--   Local chart completion and random-tape decoding
-- statement:
--   Local flag draws are completed by choosing charts from the finite legal set and by using a fixed legal fallback. The interface specifies chart iteration, completion, and the parsing of the public random tape into seed, proposal, and completion data. All branches retain the same public placement.
